AKE, TETSUYA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHTA, TOMIO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A device capable of supplying a cancer therapeutic agent to an object (24) to be treated only as quickly as possible, comprising a fluid replacement supply unit (A) which measures a fluid replacement including a cancer therapeutic agent for injection into a blood vessel going into the object, and a fluid replacement conduction unit (B) which measure a liquid replacement having passed the object for conduction from a blood vessel coming out from the object.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un dispositif capable d'injecter un agent thérapeutique anticancéreux à un objet (24) devant être traité aussi rapidement que possible. Ce dispositif comporte un ensemble (A) d'apport de remplacement liquidien qui mesure un remplacement liquidien contenant un agent thérapeutique anticancéreux devant être injecté dans un vaisseau sanguin pénétrant dans l'objet, et un ensemble (B) de conduction de remplacement liquidien qui mesure le remplacement liquidien ayant traversé l'objet pour l'amener du vaisseau sanguin à l'extérieur de l'objet.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>